---
layout: base.njk
title: "About Pockit"
description: "Pockit started as one lecturer's fix for a distracted classroom. Here's the story, and what we're building toward."
---

<section class="about-hero">
  <div class="about-hero-photo"></div>

  <div class="about-hero-inner">
    <div class="about-hero-text">
      <h1>Our lives are scrolling away.</h1>
      <p>Be it work or pleasure or learning, we're up against needy attention-seeking business models with each new app we use.</p>
      <p>The digital solutions to address our smartphone addictions are not working.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="page-section page-section--alt">
  <div class="page-section-inner page-section-inner--wide about-intro">
    <h2><span class="h2-brand">Pockit</span> is a <span class="h2-strike">digital</span> wellbeing venture.</h2>
    <p class="page-section-intro">Pockit is founded on an embarrassingly simple answer to device addiction: <strong>smartphone-sized publishing</strong>.</p>

    <div class="feature-grid">
      <div class="feature-item">
        <div class="feature-icon">
          <!-- A phone/card laid down, an arrow rising up and away from
               it toward open space — looking up from the device. -->
          <svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" stroke="#999" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <rect x="12" y="20" width="16" height="16" rx="2"/>
            <line x1="16" y1="24" x2="24" y2="24" stroke="#ddd"/>
            <path d="M20 16 L20 4" stroke="var(--brand-green)"/>
            <path d="M14 10 L20 4 L26 10" stroke="var(--brand-green)"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Take time to look up</h3>
        <p>Pockit is here to give you breathing space to look up again, to let your mind wander, to sit with a problem, to reclaim your time from distraction.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-item">
        <div class="feature-icon">
          <!-- A phone with a notification pinging out from it — a
               tool that's become a needy, attention-seeking service. -->
          <svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" stroke="#999" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <rect x="9" y="5" width="18" height="30" rx="3"/>
            <line x1="15" y1="9" x2="21" y2="9" stroke="#ddd"/>
            <circle cx="18" cy="20" r="1.6" fill="var(--brand-green)" stroke="none"/>
            <path d="M28 14 q4 6 0 12" stroke="var(--brand-green)"/>
            <path d="M32 11 q8 9 0 18" stroke="var(--brand-green)"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Smartphones as tools</h3>
        <p>When tools become services, and even worse, free services, their utility comes at the expense of needy engagement, interferring with our development.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-item">
        <div class="feature-icon">
          <!-- A small ruled card with a pencil writing on it — the
               fine motor act of handwriting, on Pockit's own pocket-
               sized format. -->
          <svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" stroke="#999" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <rect x="6" y="8" width="20" height="26" rx="2"/>
            <line x1="10" y1="15" x2="22" y2="15" stroke="#ddd"/>
            <line x1="10" y1="20" x2="18" y2="20" stroke="#ddd"/>
            <path d="M24 24 L34 14" stroke="var(--brand-green)"/>
            <path d="M32 12 l3 3 -2 2 -3-3z" fill="var(--brand-green)" stroke="none"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Handwriting works</h3>
        <p>The act of handwriting, with all the fine motor skills your brain orchestrates, is better for thinking than typing and tapping. Pockit posits the smaller the better!</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

